      "quote": "The search strategy was applied to Ovid-MEDLINE and ... translated to other databases (Ovid-MEDLINE, Embase, CINAHL, Cochrane CENTRAL, Web of Science, IEEE Xplore, Scopus) after validation and revision with the team. The relevant search strategy can be found in S1 Appendix.",
      "reason": "Full search strategies for all seven databases are reported in the S1 Appendix, with the MEDLINE strategy translated to other databases."
